OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit closure: What are
OL,4,Anext steps?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPregnant women living in a rural area
OL,7,Fof Devon say the suspension of a
OL,8,Fmaternity services has left them
OL,9,Ffeeling anxious about their birthing
OL,10,Fplans.
OL,12,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,13,FNHS Foundation Trust (RDUH) suspended
OL,14,Fstandard birthing services at North
OL,15,FDevon District Hospital (NDDH) in
OL,16,FBarnstaple on 11 August, which it said
OL,17,Fit was the "only safe course of action"
OL,18,Fdue to staffing issues.
OL,23,APub: 11-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
