OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit closure: What are
OL,4,Anext steps?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it began planning for a
OL,7,Fpotential temporary suspension to
OL,8,Fservices in July due to serious
OL,9,Fstaffing issues.
OL,11,FAt the beginning of August, the trust
OL,12,Fsaid it had explored and exhausted
OL,13,Fevery option, including securing locum
OL,14,Fcover and mutual aid support from
OL,15,Fpartner organisations, and concluded a
OL,16,Ftemporary suspension was the best
OL,17,Fsolution.
OL,23,APub: 11-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
